ntent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":350,"closed_issues":2337,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:02Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-04-18T22:25:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:05:53Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T15:02:41Z","assignee":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on Godot 4.4.1\n- Reproducible on master/[2d3bdcac35ac22ee6c4d5d5edc88ba947d0659d5]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (2d3bdcac3) - EndeavourOS #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 10 Apr 2025 18:43:59 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 (nvidia; 570.133.07) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot's LSP doesn't know how to handle replies from the client (these replies have no `method` field,  only an `id`).\n\nThe only instance I have notice this happening is after connecting a signal to a node from the editor, which adds a boilerplate handler.\n\nFor instance, when adding a signal to a script from the editor, the Godot LSP sends a `workspace/applyEdit` to the LSP client:\n\n```\n\"rpc.receive\"\t{ id = 7, jsonrpc = \"2.0\", method = \"workspace/applyEdit\", params = { edit = { changes = { [\"file:///home/charles/Games/Testing/godot-lsp/test.gd\"] = { { newText = \"\\n\\nfunc _on_editor_description_changed(node:Node) -> void:\\n\\tpass # Replace with function body.\\n\", range = { [\"end\"] = { character = 0, line = 22 }, start = { character = 0, line = 22 } } } } } } } }\n```\n\nWhen the client has applied the edit, it replies that it was succesful with a reply to the same ID (notice the `id = 7` in both message an response):\n\n```\n\"rpc.send\"\t{ id = 7, jsonrpc = \"2.0\", result = { applied = true } }\n```\n\nWhn Godot recieves this message, it replies with and error:\n```\n\"rpc.receive\"\t{ error = { code = -32601, message = \"Method not found: \" }, id = 7, jsonrpc = \"2.0\" }\n\"No callback found for server response id 7\"\n```\n\nIt appears Godot doesn't know how to handle client replies, specifically anything which doesn't have a `method`.\n\nThe `workspace/applyEdit` spec (https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/specifications/lsp/3.17/specification/#workspace_applyEdit) says the client should reply this this message when it's applied.\n\nHappy to provide more information on request. I'm also reachable on Discord (same username).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI am using Neovim's LSP implementation, although I have not yet tested with other LSP clients (e.g. VS Code).\n\n1. Configure an external editor. I am using Neovim (with AstroNvim with AstroCommunity's Godot pack which configures the LSP. I'm happy to provide information how to set this up)\n1. Create a new scene, add a node, attach a script to the scene\n1. Open the script file in the LSP client/editor (this should be done automatically when creating the script)\n1. Connect a signal on the node to the script\n1. This should throw the error within the client as the server (Godot) has replied with an error\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105544/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}